{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062062/block/singleImage/3258162/df/01M6K8TY3TGZ0TQ4NTYN0FHMYF.jpeg?updatedAt=1793803701\"/><figcaption>雲浩影及馮允謙今年各自派了3首歌上台。(蘇文傑攝)</figcaption></figure><p>馮允謙(Jay)、雲浩影(Cloud)出席《叱咤樂壇流行榜頒獎典禮》記者會。Jay及Cloud就希望黃淑蔓可以獲女歌手獎，Jay希望可以見到陳健安及黃淑蔓上台。 Jay稱自己也只是出了3首歌，七月也出了一張英文碟，也跟Gin Lee一樣「出年再嚟過！」Cloud表示今年同樣也只出了3首歌，自己有很多歌留明年出，但MV未拍好，同時想找一個好的時間推出。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062062/block/singleImage/3258171/wm/01M6K917W60RKS2VD0FHG14DT8.jpeg?updatedAt=1793803701\"/><figcaption>黃淑蔓今年在樂壇成績不錯。(蘇文傑攝)</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1062062/block/singleImage/3258188/wm/01M6KAZBK5DGVVD74ZZ7F62KQ2.jpeg?updatedAt=1793803701\"/><figcaption>Jay Fung睇好陳健安拎男歌手獎。(蘇文傑攝)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:05:41.084018+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":248,"images":3,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T12:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T16:58:30.811215+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:26.864252+00:00","content_hash":"79066187c736a76bdcd07bbf18f77bb878c13a542473440383c97434e857659b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}